---
// The one picture of CretSpec: what you maintain, what it builds and what an agent gets.
---

<figure class="overview not-content">
  <div class="flow">
    <div class="stage">
      <p class="label">You maintain</p>
      <div class="box">
        <strong>Spec repository</strong>
        <span><code>project.json</code> lists the repositories. Holds the project's rules and skills.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <strong>Code repositories</strong>
        <span>One or several, each with its own history.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <strong>AI guidelines</strong>
        <span>Shared rules and skills: yours, plus a customer's if needed.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="arrow">
      <code>cspec project<br />clone</code>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 52 12" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="0" y1="6" x2="44" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
        <polygon points="43,1 52,6 43,11" fill="currentColor"></polygon>
      </svg>
      <small>once, then<br /><code>cspec sync</code></small>
    </div>
    <div class="stage">
      <p class="label">CretSpec builds</p>
      <pre class="tree">Atlas/
├─ <span class="generated">AGENTS.md</span>
├─ <span class="generated">.agents/skills/</span>
├─ atlas-spec/
├─ atlas/
│  ├─ <span class="generated">AGENTS.md</span>
│  ├─ <span class="generated">.agents/skills/</span>
│  └─ src/ …
├─ ai-guidelines/
└─ acme-handbook/</pre>
      <p class="key">
        <span><i></i>your repositories</span>
        <span class="generated"><i></i>generated, never committed</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="arrow">
      <small>reads</small>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 52 12" aria-hidden="true">
        <line x1="0" y1="6" x2="44" y2="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></line>
        <polygon points="43,1 52,6 43,11" fill="currentColor"></polygon>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="stage">
      <p class="label">Your agent knows</p>
      <div class="box">
        <strong>Which repositories exist</strong>
        <span>and what each one is for.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <strong>Which rules apply</strong>
        <span>in the folder it was started in.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="box">
        <strong>Which skills it can use</strong>
      </div>
      <p class="agents">Claude Code, Codex, Copilot and Cursor all get this context.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="label">When two sources disagree, the first one wins</p>
    <ol class="order">
      <li class="first">Project rules</li>
      <li>Your guidelines</li>
      <li>Further guidelines</li>
      <li>Referenced projects</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">Project rules always come first. <code>priority</code> reorders the others.</p>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <strong>One definition, the same context everywhere.</strong> You keep the left side in Git. CretSpec builds the
    middle. Every agent starts from the same instructions and skills, whichever folder it opens.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .overview {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    container-type: inline-size;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .label {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font: 0.65rem/1.5 var(--sl-font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .stage > .label {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 6.25rem minmax(0, 1.15fr) 3.25rem minmax(0, 0.85fr);
  }
  .stage {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-content: start;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .box {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7, var(--sl-color-gray-6));
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }
  .box strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .box span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  code {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92em;
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .arrow {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 1.6rem 0.25rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .arrow > code {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .arrow small {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .arrow svg {
    width: 2.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tree {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7, var(--sl-color-gray-6));
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    font: 0.75rem/1.65 var(--sl-font-mono);
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .generated {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }
  .tree .generated {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .key {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem 0.9rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .key i {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .key .generated i {
    background: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }
  .agents,
  .note {
    margin: 0.15rem 0.1rem 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .order {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: order;
  }
  .order li {
    counter-increment: order;
    padding: 0.1rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .order li::before {
    content: counter(order);
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
    font: 600 0.7rem var(--sl-font-mono);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }
  .order .first {
    border-color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }
  .note {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  figcaption {
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-light);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }
  figcaption strong {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  @container (max-width: 36rem) {
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .arrow {
      padding: 0.75rem 0;
    }
    .arrow svg {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      margin: 0.9rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
